### Figure 7 — as printed in the paper

Figure 7. Visualization of a CIFAR-10 cluster. The first row shows representative images from the cluster. Using these images, we apply reverse ODE to estimate the μ0,k and Σ0,k (Fig. 3, Stage 1). The second row shows images generated by sampling noise from this estimated distribution. The last row presents the results after finetuning the pretrained flow model.

